  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Two problems are addressed for the path of certain stochastic processes: a) do they define currents? b) are these currents of a classical type? A general answer to question a) is given for processes like semimartingales or with Lyons-Zheng structure. As to question b), it is shown that Hölder continuous paths with exponent $\\gamma > 1/2$ define integral flat chains.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
